          Schedule a Free Consultation
        </a>
        <a
          href="/about-us"
          class="bg-secondary text-foreground border border-secondary px-5 py-3 rounded-[4px] font-medium text-[16px] hover:bg-secondary-hover transition-colors no-underline inline-block"
